      </a>
    </li>

    <li style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">
      <a href="/resources/why-some-car-accident-claims-stop-moving-forward-california">
        Why some car accident claims stop moving forward
      </a>
    </li>

    <li style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">
      <a href="/resources/can-pain-show-up-days-after-a-car-accident">
        Can pain show up days after a car accident?
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
        <section style="margin-top: 2rem; opacity: 0.9;">
          <p style="margin: 0;">
            <strong>Important:</strong> This page is general educational information, not legal advice. Pinto Injury Resources is not a law firm and does not provide legal
